lass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simply\\text{-}connected} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\bigl(|\\pi_1(X,\\tau,x_0)|=1\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simply\\text{-}connected} \\vdash \\mathrm{SimplyConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PathConnected}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x_0\\in X\\;\\bigl(|\\pi_1(X,\\tau,x_0)|=1\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cardinality-one clause expresses that the fundamental group is trivial without identifying a group with the number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Equivalent: every loop is null-homotopic</li>\n<li>Covering space: universal cover <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tilde{X} \\to X\">\\(\\tilde{X} \\to X\\)</span> if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(X)\">\\(\\pi_1(X)\\)</span> is discrete</li>\n<li>Seifert-van Kampen: compute <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_1\\)</span> from pieces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":